title: "Quantum VQE Chemistry Lab"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, open-source laboratory for variational quantum eigensolver
  experiments in quantum chemistry, with a validated H2/STO-3G reference run,
  exact diagonalization, independent PySCF FCI checks and a local Streamlit
  dashboard.
